WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
In Redact, choose Text and mark the words to remove.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Choose Area and mark a larger region.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Review the marks, then confirm Apply redactions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.400
The marked content is removed. Check the result before export.
